abstract: >-
  SecureGate is an evidence-aware security gate for GitHub Actions that validates the evidence of Semgrep,
  pip-audit and Gitleaks before deciding PASS, BLOCK or INCOMPLETE. This release contains the gate, the EXP-02
  fault-injection harness, the frozen protocol (SHA-256 4716bbba6a3899cb2680b8455da6c171ae7e2f1c38ba97ff2f20cef4b2d30fed)
  and the analysis script; raw results of the final run (GitHub Actions run 44892918564) are on the branch
  semester8-exp02-results.
